# 📖 Overview

This repository contains a **production-ready Django application** following industry best practices for scalability, maintainability, and security.

Designed with a modular architecture, the project supports rapid development while remaining easy to extend for enterprise-scale applications.

---

# 🏗 Architecture

```text
                    Client
                      │
          ┌───────────▼───────────┐
          │      Django URLs      │
          └───────────┬───────────┘
                      │
              Views / ViewSets
                      │
             Business Services
                      │
        Models ───── ORM ───── Database
                      │
               Redis / Cache
                      │
             Background Workers
```

---

# 🛠 Tech Stack

| Technology | Purpose |
|------------|---------|
| Python | Backend Language |
| Django | Web Framework |
| Django REST Framework | REST APIs |
| PostgreSQL | Database |
| Redis | Cache & Queue |
| Celery | Background Tasks |
| Docker | Containerization |
| Gunicorn | WSGI Server |
| Nginx | Reverse Proxy |
| GitHub Actions | CI/CD |

